================================================================================

WHEN TO USE EACH PAGE:
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Situation                          Go to Page                    What to do
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Daily check                        Fraud Detection → Overview   See if anything 
                                                                   suspicious 
                                                                   happened
                                                                   overnight
Investigate fraud                   Fraud Detection →            Look at specific
                                   Hybrid Detection             suspicious 
                                                                   transactions
Find criminal networks             Fraud Detection →            See how accounts
                                   Network Graph                are connected
Understand why flagged             Fraud Detection →            See exactly why
                                   SHAP Explainability         computer flagged
                                                                   something
Adjust security rules             Fraud Detection →            Change what the
                                   Config Thresholds            system looks for
Process bank statements           Multi-Banking → Upload      Upload files from
                                                                   different banks
Find specific transaction          Transactions → Search        Search and filter
                                                                   through all 
                                                                   transactions
Create management report           Reports → Generate           Make PDF/CSV 
                                                                   reports for 
                                                                   meetings
See fraud trends                   Reports → Time Series        Check if fraud is
                                                                   increasing or 
                                                                   decreasing

QUICK ACTIONS:
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Need                                    Action
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Stop a suspicious transfer              Go to Hybrid Detection, click 
                                         transaction, flag for review
Change fraud sensitivity                Go to Config Thresholds, 
                                         adjust sliders
Add new suspicious word                  Go to Config Thresholds, 
                                         add to MOTS_CLES_SENSIBLES
Process daily statements                 Go to Multi-Banking, upload 
                                         all bank files
Check weekly performance                 Go to Reports, set date range, 
                                         generate report
Investigate a customer                  Go to Network Graph, enter 
                                         their account number

